# Only a motion's shortcut direction counts: no motion has 3, and the dummy has no 3b or 2b, so 3 + special + b
# starts nothing. The special button alone starts nothing either.
setup: p1 character scenario_dummy
setup: p2 character scenario_dummy
frame 1: p1 3special+b
frame 10: p1 5special

frames 1-15: expect p1 state != attack
